{"type":"message","id":"5a06f0db","parentId":"d59b697a","timestamp":"2026-03-20T06:45:13.320Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"网络请求被终止了。让我尝试用更简单的方式获取信息。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_6kgdf4bgeedi_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s --connect-timeout 10 \"https://test-time-training.github.io/video-dit/\" 2>/dev/null | head -100","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":265,"output":80,"cacheRead":36093,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36438,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773989106997}}
{"type":"message","id":"b45ecf9c","parentId":"5a06f0db","timestamp":"2026-03-20T06:45:15.319Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_6kgdf4bgeedi_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>One-Minute Video Generation with Test-Time Training</title>\n\n  <!-- SEO Meta Tags -->\n  <meta name=\"description\"\n    content=\"Explore our novel method for generating one-minute videos from text prompts using Test-Time Training (TTT) layers, surpassing Mamba 2 and DeltaNet in coherence and story complexity.\" />\n  <meta name=\"keywords\"\n    content=\"video generation, TTT layers, transformers, machine learning, test-time training, Tom and Jerry, video synthesis, story generation, AI videos\" />\n  <meta name=\"author\"\n    content=\"Karan Dalal, Daniel Koceja, Gashon Hussein, Jiarui Xu, Yue Zhao, Youjin Song, Shihao Han, Ka Chun Cheung, Jan Kautz, Carlos Guestrin, Tatsunori Hashimoto, Sanmi Koyejo, Yejin Choi, Yu Sun, Xiaolong Wang\" />\n\n  <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"One-Minute Video Generation with Test-Time Training\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:description\"\n    content=\"A new approach using Test-Time Training (TTT) layers to generate coherent, minute-long videos from text.\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n\n  <!-- Twitter Card Meta Tags -->\n  <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"One-Minute Video Generation with Test-Time Training\" />\n  <meta name=\"twitter:description\"\n    content=\"Generate story-driven, minute-long videos using TTT layers in pre-trained Transformers. See demos and baselines.\" />\n\n  <!-- Styles -->\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"main.css\" />\n<script defer src=\"https://cloud.umami.is/script.js\" data-website-id=\"46fb7b42-7fcc-4ad0-8cd3-425b0c99828d\"></script>\n</head>\n\n<script async src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-TN8N5Y8RSC\"></script>\n<script>\n  window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\n  function gtag() { dataLayer.push(arguments); }\n  gtag('js', new Date());\n\n  gtag('config', 'G-TN8N5Y8RSC');\n</script>\n\n<body>\n  <!-- Scroll space -->\n  <div class=\"hero\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Scroll indicator -->\n  <div class=\"scroll-indicator\">></div>\n\n  <!-- Demo Videos heading -->\n  <div class=\"demo-videos-heading\">\n    <h1>One-Minute Demo Videos</h1>\n    <p>Click any video to see the text prompt used to generate it.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 3×2 Grid of video slots (target slot is the middle cell of the first row) -->\n  <div class=\"grid-container\">\n    <div class=\"video-slot\">\n      <video src=\"videos/63s-demo/homeless.mp4\" autoplay muted loop playsinline webkit-playsinline\n        data-prompt-summary=\"Jerry happily eats cheese in a tidy kitchen until Tom playfully takes it away, teasing him. Annoyed, Jerry packs his belongings and leaves home, dragging a small suitcase behind him. Later, Tom notices Jerry's absence, feels sad, and follows Jerry's tiny footprints all the way to San Francisco. Jerry sits disheartened in an alleyway, where Tom finds him, gently offering cheese as an apology. Jerry forgives Tom, accepts the cheese, and the two return home together, their friendship restored.\"\n        data-prompt=\"<start_scene>The kitchen is tidy, featuring walls painted soft yellow and a checkered tile floor in white and pale blue. At the center stands a rectangular wooden kitchen table stained brown. Jerry, the brown mouse, sits upright on the kitchen table, holding a small block of yellow cheese in both paws. The camera remains steady, capturing Jerry's wide smile as he lifts the cheese toward his mouth and happily takes a large bite.\n          \nThe kitchen is tidy, featuring walls painted soft yellow and a checkered tile floor in white and pale blue. At the center stands a rectangular wooden kitchen table stained brown. Jerry, the brown mouse, continues sitting on the table, holding his cheese and preparing to take another bite. Tom, the blue-gray cat, calmly walks toward Jerry from the right side of the frame, extending one paw to gently take the cheese from Jerry's before Jerry can bite again. The camera moves slightly closer, capturing Tom's mischievous expression and Jerry's angry, confused reaction as the cheese is taken away.\n          \nThe kitchen is tidy, featuring walls painted soft yellow and a checkered tile floor in white and pale blue. At the center stands a rectangular wooden kitchen table stained brown. Tom, the blue-gray cat, stands beside the table holding the yellow cheese just above Jerry's head, gently moving it up and down in a teasing manner. Jerry, the brown mouse, stands on the table below Tom, repeatedly jumping in the air and reaching upward with his paws, trying unsuccessfully to grab the cheese.<end_scene>\n\n<start_scene>The wall is painted soft yellow, with a small, rounded mouse hole visible near the bottom edge. The floor is checkered tile in white and pale blue, stretching neatly toward the mouse hole. Jerry, the brown mouse, stands on the tiled floor, facing toward the mouse hole. His eyes are narrowed and ears slightly flattened, clearly annoyed. The camera steadily follows Jerry as he firmly walks leftward toward the mouse hole, his footsteps deliberate and his expression frustrated as he approaches its entrance.<end_scene>\n\n<start_scene>The mouse hole features gently curved walls painted soft gray and a smooth wooden floor with a clear grain pattern. At the center stands a small wooden table, and against the left wall sits a small bed neatly covered with a yellow blanket and a white pillow. Jerry, the brown mouse, stands on the floor, carefully placing clothes into a small blue suitcase. Near him are small brown cardboard boxes stacked neatly, filled with Jerry's belongings. The camera steadily moves closer, capturing Jerry's focused expression as he continues packing his suitcase.<end_scene>\n\n<start_scene>In front of the house is a neat yard with green grass and a short stone pathway leading away from a white front door. The house exterior is painted pale yellow, and the door is painted white with a small round handle. Jerry, the brown mouse, walks slowly away from the front door toward the sidewalk, pulling a small blue suitcase behind him. The camera steadily tracks Jerry's movements, clearly capturing his annoyed expression as he continues walking toward the curb.<end_scene>\n\n<start_scene>The wall is painted soft yellow, with a small rounded mouse hole visible near the bottom edge. Tom, the blue-gray cat, sits facing the mouse hole, looking directly toward it with a confused and worried expression. The camera slowly zooms in, clearly capturing Tom's puzzled eyes and slightly tilted head as he stares quietly at the empty mouse hole.\n\nThe wall is painted soft yellow, with a small rounded mouse hole visible near the bottom edge. Tom, the blue-gray cat, continues sitting facing the mouse hole, eyes wide and expression becoming visibly sad. The camera moves slowly closer, capturing a single tear forming in Tom's eye and gently rolling down his cheek as he quietly gazes at the empty mouse hole.\n\nThe wall is painted soft yellow, with a small rounded mouse hole visible near the bottom edge. Tom, the blue-gray cat, stands up from his seated position, walks toward a nearby brown wooden table, and picks up a small block of yellow cheese with one paw. The camera steadily follows Tom's movements, clearly capturing his determined expression as he thoughtfully holds and examines the cheese.<end_scene>\n\n<start_scene>In front of the house is a neat yard with green grass and a short stone pathway leading away from a white front door. The house exterior is painted pale yellow, and the door is painted white with a small round handle. Tom, the blue-gray cat, stands upright in front of the door. With a determined expression, Tom begins walking away from the front door toward the curb.<end_scene>\n\n<start_scene>The sidewalk is pale gray concrete, lined by buildings on both sides, leading toward a dark alleyway in the distance. In the background, the San Francisco Golden Gate Bridge stands out clearly against a bright blue sky. Tiny mouse footprints are visible on the sidewalk, leading toward the alley. Tom, the blue-gray cat, walks in from the left side of the frame. He pauses midway and kneels down, carefully examining the mouse tracks.\n\nThe sidewalk is pale gray concrete, lined by buildings on both sides, leading toward a dark alleyway in the distance. The tiny mouse footprints continue visibly along the ground toward the alley. In the background, the San Francisco Golden Gate Bridge stands out clearly against a bright blue sky. Tiny mouse footprints are visible on the sidewalk, leading toward the alley. Tom stands up after examining the tracks, looking determined. He continues walking toward the right side of the frame, following the direction of the footprints, and moves out of view.<end_scene>\n\n<start_scene>The alley is narrow, with tall brick walls painted faded red and a cracked gray concrete ground. At the center stands a rusty metal shopping cart containing several small cardboard boxes stacked unevenly, and positioned just beside it on the ground is a small blue suitcase. Jerry, the brown mouse, sits on top his suitcase next to the cart, displaying a weary posture and a disheartened expression as he gazes downward.\n\nThe alley is narrow, with tall brick walls painted faded red and a cracked gray concrete ground. At the center stands a rusty metal shopping cart containing several small cardboard boxes stacked unevenly, and positioned just beside it on the ground is a small blue suitcase. Jerry, the brown mouse, sits on top his suitcase next to the cart, displaying a weary posture and a disheartened expression as he gazes downward. Tom, the blue-gray cat, calmly approaches Jerry from the right side of the frame, stepping carefully across the concrete. The camera steadily captures Tom's relieved expression and wide smile as he moves toward Jerry.\n\nThe alley is narrow, with tall brick walls painted faded red and a cracked gray concrete ground. At the center stands a rusty metal shopping cart containing several small cardboard boxes stacked unevenly, and positioned just beside it on the ground is a small blue suitcase. Jerry, the brown mouse, sits on top his suitcase next to the cart. Tom, the blue-gray cat, stands quietly near the cart, observing Jerry, the brown mouse. Tom slowly reveals the small block of yellow cheese he's been holding, raising it gently toward Jerry with a hopeful glance. The camera steadily captures Tom's hopeful expression.\n\nThe alley is narrow, with tall brick walls painted faded red and a cracked gray concrete ground. At the center stands a rusty metal shopping cart containing several small cardboard boxes stacked unevenly, and positioned just beside it on the ground is a small blue suitcase. Jerry, the brown mouse, sits on top of his suitcase next to the cart. Tom, the blue-gray cat, calmly extends his paw, offering Jerry a small block of yellow cheese. The camera steadily moves closer, clearly capturing Jerry's expression shifting from frustrated to happy and forgiving as he accepts Tom's offering.\n\nThe alley is narrow, with tall brick walls painted faded red and a cracked gray concrete ground. At the center stands a rusty metal shopping cart containing several small cardboard boxes stacked unevenly, and positioned just beside it on the ground is a small blue suitcase. Jerry, the brown mouse, sits on top of his suitcase next to the cart. Jerry is holding the small block of yellow cheese from Tom. Tom, the blue-gray cat, smiles gently as he watches Jerry, clearly pleased. The camera steadily captures Jerry's cheerful smile and Tom's gentle, relieved expression.<end_scene>\n\n<start_scene>The alley is narrow, with brick walls on both sides and a gray concrete ground with visible cracks. At the center, Tom, the blue-gray cat, walks calmly toward the alley's exit, gently pushing the rustry metal shopping cart containing small cardboard boxes and a small blue suitcase placed neatly beside them. Jerry, the brown mouse, sits comfortably inside the front section of the cart, holding a small block of yellow cheese in his paws. The camera remains steady behind them, clearly capturing Jerry's happy expression as he eats his cheese and Tom's relaxed movements pushing the cart toward the bright alley opening.<end_scene>\n\n<start_scene>The room is neatly organized, featuring walls painted in a soft beige tone and a carpeted floor with a subtle pattern. On the left wall is a small, rounded mouse hole. Jerry, the brown mouse, calmly walks across the carpet toward his mouse hole, carrying his small blue suitcase firmly in one paw. Tom, the blue-gray cat, stands quietly in the background, observing Jerry with a pleased, gentle smile. The camera steadily captures Jerry entering his mouse hole, clearly showing Tom's happy and relieved expression.<end_scene>\n\n<start_scene>The living room features pale walls, a large brown armchair positioned comfortably at the center, and a soft cream-colored rug. Tom, the blue-gray cat, sits relaxed in the armchair, happily eating a cookie. Jerry, the brown mouse, sits beside Tom on the armrest, cheerfully nibbling a small block of yellow cheese. The camera steadily captures their joyful expressions as they enjoy their snacks side by side.\n\nThe living room has soft pale walls, a comfortable brown armchair at the center, and a cream-colored rug. Tom sets his cookie aside and smiles warmly at Jerry. Jerry puts down his cheese and stands on the armrest, facing Tom with a happy grin. Tom raises his paw toward Jerry, and they share a playful and friendly high-five, celebrating their renewed friendship. The camera slowly pulls back, capturing their joyful moment, and gradually fades to black.<end_scene>\">\n      </video>"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1987,"aggregated":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>One-Minute Video Generation with Test-Time Training</title>\n\n  <!-- SEO Meta Tags -->\n  <meta name=\"description\"\n    content=\"Explore our novel method for generating one-minute videos from text prompts using Test-Time Training (TTT) layers, surpassing Mamba 2 and DeltaNet in coherence and story complexity.\" />\n  <meta name=\"keywords\"\n    content=\"video generation, TTT layers, transformers, machine learning, test-time training, Tom and Jerry, video synthesis, story generation, AI videos\" />\n  <meta name=\"author\"\n    content=\"Karan Dalal, Daniel Koceja, Gashon Hussein, Jiarui Xu, Yue Zhao, Youjin Song, Shihao Han, Ka Chun Cheung, Jan Kautz, Carlos Guestrin, Tatsunori Hashimoto, Sanmi Koyejo, Yejin Choi, Yu Sun, Xiaolong Wang\" />\n\n  <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"One-Minute Video Generation with Test-Time Training\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:description\"\n    content=\"A new approach using Test-Time Training (TTT) layers to generate coherent, minute-long videos from text.\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n\n  <!-- Twitter Card Meta Tags -->\n  <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"One-Minute Video Generation with Test-Time Training\" />\n  <meta name=\"twitter:description\"\n    content=\"Generate story-driven, minute-long videos using TTT layers in pre-trained Transformers. See demos and baselines.\" />\n\n  <!-- Styles -->\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"main.css\" />\n<script defer src=\"https://cloud.umami.is/script.js\" data-website-id=\"46fb7b42-7fcc-4ad0-8cd3-425b0c99828d\"></script>\n</head>\n\n<script async src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-TN8N5Y8RSC\"></